{"parse":{"title":"个性/铁腕宰相","pageid":6625,"revid":15022,"text":"<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><p><br />\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<div id=\"bread-edit\" class=\"bread-edit\" style=\"float:right;margin-top:10px;margin-right:10px\"><sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7/%E9%93%81%E8%85%95%E5%AE%B0%E7%9B%B8&amp;action=edit\">编</a></sup> <sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7/%E9%93%81%E8%85%95%E5%AE%B0%E7%9B%B8&amp;action=purge\">刷</a></sup> <sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7/%E9%93%81%E8%85%95%E5%AE%B0%E7%9B%B8&amp;action=history\">历</a></sup></div>\n<div style=\"padding: 5px 10px;margin: 10px 0;border: 1px solid #ebccd1;border-left-width: 5px;border-radius: 3px;background: rgb(255 255 255 / 40%);\">\n<a href=\"/llzj/%E9%A6%96%E9%A1%B5\" title=\"首页\">首页</a> &gt; <a href=\"/llzj/%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93\" title=\"技能图鉴库\">技能图鉴库</a> &gt; <b>铁腕宰相</b><br /></div>\n<hr />\n<h2><span id=\".E9.93.81.E8.85.95.E5.AE.B0.E7.9B.B8\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"铁腕宰相\"><b>铁腕宰相</b></span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%A8%A1%E6%9D%BF:%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=T-1\" title=\"编辑章节：\">编辑</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:center\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"3\">个性详情\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"text-nowrap\" style=\"width:20%;\" rowspan=\"5\"><img alt=\"个性 铁腕宰相.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/4/4a/khzafztpvxa5qcvrk0ht0mazh8jtm52.png/80px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7_%E9%93%81%E8%85%95%E5%AE%B0%E7%9B%B8.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/4/4a/khzafztpvxa5qcvrk0ht0mazh8jtm52.png/120px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7_%E9%93%81%E8%85%95%E5%AE%B0%E7%9B%B8.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/4/4a/khzafztpvxa5qcvrk0ht0mazh8jtm52.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" /><br />铁腕宰相\n</th>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\" style=\"width:60%;\">&#160;<img alt=\"个性一星.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/f/ff/it8jh8njwjg4jrxn4b2f0iwnlxlm1a7.png/56px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%80%E6%98%9F.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"56\" height=\"14\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/f/ff/it8jh8njwjg4jrxn4b2f0iwnlxlm1a7.png/84px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%80%E6%98%9F.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/f/ff/it8jh8njwjg4jrxn4b2f0iwnlxlm1a7.png/112px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%80%E6%98%9F.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"224\" data-file-height=\"56\" /><br />&#160;\n<p>✦拥有额外技能[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"征伐敕令\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">征伐敕令</font></span></span>]。所有阵营为&lt;埃拉曼&gt;的己方进行召唤时，使召唤物获得<font color=\"#58cb48\">2</font>层[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"解放\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">解放</font></span></span>]。<br />✦当[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">基安希尔</span>]行动开始时，位于其范围<font color=\"#ed7950\">1</font>格内所有[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"帝国不朽军\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">帝国不朽军</font></span></span>]，将在[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">基安希尔</span>]行动结束时传送至其身边。<br />✦战斗开始获得<font color=\"#ed7950\">6</font>层[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"解放\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">解放</font></span></span>]。行动开始时，在周围召唤1名[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"帝国不朽军\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">帝国不朽军</font></span></span>]，每<font color=\"#ed7950\">4</font>回合最多触发1次。<br />✦自身召唤[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"帝国不朽军\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">帝国不朽军</font></span></span>]时将[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"指定增益\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">指定增益</font></span></span>]复制给目标，并使其获得<font color=\"#ed7950\">5</font>层[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"战争杀器\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">战争杀器</font></span></span>]，持续3回合。<br />✦使自身和场上[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"帝国不朽军\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">帝国不朽军</font></span></span>]速度降低<font color=\"#ed7950\">50</font>点、攻防属性提高<font color=\"#ed7950\">5%</font>，并获得[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"▲攻击1\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">▲攻击1</font></span></span>]、[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"▲伤害1\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">▲伤害1</font></span></span>]。\n</p>\n</td>\n<td class=\"text-nowrap\" style=\"width:20%;\" rowspan=\"5\"><b>该个性属于</b><br /><br /><div class=\"hero_head\" style=\"width:90px;height:90px;\">\n<div class=\"hero_head_img\"><a href=\"/llzj/%E8%A7%92%E8%89%B2%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E5%9F%BA%E5%AE%89%E5%B8%8C%E5%B0%94\" title=\"角色图鉴库/基安希尔\"><img alt=\"头像 基安希尔.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/6/61/fl81fezqdtxw1h6zsryxqmfwsjh16v8.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"90\" height=\"90\" class=\"img-kk\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"64\" /></a></div>\n<div class=\"hero_head_name\" style=\"width:90px;\"><font color=\"#fff\">基安希尔</font></div>\n</div>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\">&#160;<img alt=\"个性二星.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/e/e0/s8dzgwxdvuvhjug8aqjcnr6vmgsi5ao.png/56px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%BA%8C%E6%98%9F.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"56\" height=\"14\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/e/e0/s8dzgwxdvuvhjug8aqjcnr6vmgsi5ao.png/84px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%BA%8C%E6%98%9F.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/e/e0/s8dzgwxdvuvhjug8aqjcnr6vmgsi5ao.png/112px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%BA%8C%E6%98%9F.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"224\" data-file-height=\"56\" /><br />&#160;\n<p>✦拥有额外技能[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"征伐敕令\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">征伐敕令</font></span></span>]。所有阵营为&lt;埃拉曼&gt;的己方进行召唤时，使召唤物获得<font color=\"#58cb48\">2</font>层[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"解放\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">解放</font></span></span>]。<br />✦当[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">基安希尔</span>]行动开始时，位于其范围<font color=\"#ed7950\">1</font>格内所有[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"帝国不朽军\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">帝国不朽军</font></span></span>]，将在[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">基安希尔</span>]行动结束时传送至其身边。<br />✦战斗开始获得<font color=\"#ed7950\">6</font>层[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"解放\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">解放</font></span></span>]。行动开始时，在周围召唤1名[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"帝国不朽军\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">帝国不朽军</font></span></span>]，每<font color=\"#ed7950\">4</font>回合最多触发1次。<br />✦自身召唤[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"帝国不朽军\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">帝国不朽军</font></span></span>]时将[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"指定增益\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">指定增益</font></span></span>]复制给目标，并使其获得<font color=\"#ed7950\">5</font>层[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"战争杀器\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">战争杀器</font></span></span>]，持续3回合。<br />✦使自身和场上[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"帝国不朽军\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">帝国不朽军</font></span></span>]速度降低<font color=\"#ed7950\">50</font>点、攻防属性提高<font color=\"#ed7950\">10%</font>，并获得[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"▲攻击2\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">▲攻击2</font></span></span>]、[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"▲伤害1\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">▲伤害1</font></span></span>]。\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\">&#160;<img alt=\"个性三星.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/0/07/czx3heixk04558ia8wj7hpokhzl5cbx.png/56px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%89%E6%98%9F.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"56\" height=\"14\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/0/07/czx3heixk04558ia8wj7hpokhzl5cbx.png/84px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%89%E6%98%9F.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/0/07/czx3heixk04558ia8wj7hpokhzl5cbx.png/112px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%89%E6%98%9F.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"224\" data-file-height=\"56\" /><br />&#160;\n<p>✦拥有额外技能[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"征伐敕令\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">征伐敕令</font></span></span>]。所有阵营为&lt;埃拉曼&gt;的己方进行召唤时，使召唤物获得<font color=\"#58cb48\">2</font>层[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"解放\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">解放</font></span></span>]。<br />✦当[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">基安希尔</span>]行动开始时，位于其范围<font color=\"#ed7950\">1</font>格内所有[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"帝国不朽军\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">帝国不朽军</font></span></span>]，将在[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">基安希尔</span>]行动结束时传送至其身边。<br />✦战斗开始获得<font color=\"#ed7950\">12</font>层[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"解放\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">解放</font></span></span>]。行动开始时，在周围召唤1名[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"帝国不朽军\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">帝国不朽军</font></span></span>]，每<font color=\"#ed7950\">3</font>回合最多触发1次。<br />✦自身召唤[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"帝国不朽军\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">帝国不朽军</font></span></span>]时将[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"指定增益\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">指定增益</font></span></span>]复制给目标，并使其获得<font color=\"#ed7950\">10</font>层[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"战争杀器\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">战争杀器</font></span></span>]，持续3回合。<br />✦使自身和场上[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"帝国不朽军\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">帝国不朽军</font></span></span>]速度降低<font color=\"#ed7950\">50</font>点、攻防属性提高<font color=\"#ed7950\">10%</font>，并获得[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"▲攻击2\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">▲攻击2</font></span></span>]、[<span style=\"displa